        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 25 at 5:53AM AKDT until September 25 at 10:00AM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility as low as a quarter of a mile in dense fog.

* WHERE...Western Kupreanof Island and Kuiu Island.

* WHEN...Until 10 AM AKDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make travel conditions hazardous.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your headlights, and leave plenty of
distance ahead of you.</instruction>
